{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_9_level_main_09-17_beg","groupId":"main_9","stageId":"main_09-17","title":"長夜槍火","storyCode":"9-19","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_09-17_beg.txt","sourceHash":"c1add8d82c59ca30fa9b6c0fb147e5162c5763ede3ab7fda78875ab42d6201b8","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"21_G5_victoria_street_n_ruins"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"除了最後幾個地方，小丘郡裡已經都是我們的人了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"和料想的一樣，駐軍並沒有猜到我們把實力藏到了後面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你注意到他們剛剛的眼神了嗎？本應被摧毀殆盡的部隊再一次出現在面前，他們還以為自己見到了真正的亡靈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在歡呼勝利的時候遭遇最沉重的打擊，幾乎沒有維多利亞士兵還剩下戰鬥的意志——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖，差點忘了，我的好同學們還在城郊負隅頑抗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真是可憐，掙扎到現在，還是什麼都改變不了。就算我們不出手，他們也早就被腐朽的軍隊本身拖得精疲力盡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蔓德拉去找他們了。她一個人足夠應付。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一切看起來都在按我們的計畫進行——除了一件事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......拉芙希妮跑了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_236","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼說，我的僕臣們失敗了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說不驚訝是假的。他們雖然都是傻子，但實力都不弱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過——我們也不再需要他們了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們的野心膨脹得太快，為了謀取自己的利益，一味地急著讓戰火蔓延開去，甚至妄圖利用拉芙希妮，來瞞著你偷偷行事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"到頭來，被自己的欲望之火吞噬，也算給我們省力氣了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_236","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼你呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......咳，咳咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道我的，我只是想看見......終點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在我們第一次相遇的時候，我就這麼問過你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然生的終點註定是死，秩序無論重建多少回都必然崩潰，那走在路上的人們，是如何忍受一次又一次無謂的選擇的呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而你......你向我伸出了手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你讓我看見了本該寂滅的魂靈在死之後仍能躍動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"自那以後，我就一直想親眼看一看，在火燒穿一切之後，這片大地會是什麼樣貌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_236","isRemote":false,"text":"很貪心，也很誠實。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈......我和那些蠢人最大的差別，就是我明白該在什麼時候撒謊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以說，拉芙希妮的事怎麼處理？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_236","isRemote":false,"text":"我的妹妹，她選了誰？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"救她的人身份不明，只是，他們在城裡救了很多人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大概是......一個醫療方面的救援組織？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"實話說，我很好奇。他們看起來和任何一個國家的力量都沒什麼關係，我搞不明白他們為何要和我們作對。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_236","isRemote":false,"text":"呵呵，聽著很有趣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要我找人跟上去嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_236","isRemote":false,"text":"你來決定吧，我的謀臣。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_236","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，或許有一天，我會想親自見見他們。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"21_G5_victoria_street_n_ruins"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"傳令下去，我們的目標只有維多利亞士兵，要是再有人對居民動手，那他就是深池的敵人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"是，女士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，不是所有居民都站在我們這邊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"首先他們得相信我們是站在他們一邊的，不是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在經歷了這麼大的創傷之後，人們需要的是幫助，而非更加嚴格的管控。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，也不許對救援者下手——至少在小丘郡、在居民面前時不可以。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"火已經燒得夠旺了，差不多該熄了，不然燒到最後什麼都沒剩下，我們也就白忙了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很快，等傷口癒合，人們會記得是誰殘忍地傷害了他們，又是誰把他們拉出了地獄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"深池戰士和維多利亞士兵不一樣——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個念頭會伴隨著傷疤一起，永遠刻上死後復生的城市的心臟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"......那外面的人呢？我們現在收手的話，他們能看到嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想看的人早就看到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣就夠了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，你以為我們做這一切是為了什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為塔拉人出口氣？這話你信？你跟我都和塔拉一點關係都沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"佔領小丘郡？愚蠢自大的小丑才會這麼想。維多利亞是搖搖欲墜，但隨便哪個大公爵的軍隊都能輕鬆地把一座移動城市碾成灰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們目前要做的，僅僅只是確保這把火能燒起來，燒得讓整個維多利亞都看在眼裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"火光裡，有的人聞見了利益，有的人宣洩了仇恨，有的人找到了信仰——這算不算某種程度上的皆大歡喜？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走吧，去辦最後一件事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等做完該做的，我們也該離場了，叛徒老在檯面上活動，就比小丑還可恨了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿赫茉妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_228_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在下次登場之前，乖乖回到維多利亞為自己築好的墳墓裡，這才是鬼魂部隊該做的事——你說是不是啊，希爾？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"21_G2_opera_room"},{"type":"narration","text":"“城區全部淪陷，通訊信號丟失，無法與各隊聯絡......”\n“敵軍正在湧向基地，火力差距太明顯，我們擋不了多久了！”\n“報告......”\n“呼叫指揮中心，請立刻撤退，請立刻撤退，請——啊啊啊啊！”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"漢密爾頓上校","speakerId":"avg_npc_227_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞士兵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"上校！我們該走了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞士兵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這地方馬上就會被攻破，敵人已經包圍了我們——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"漢密爾頓上校","speakerId":"avg_npc_227_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......走？走去哪裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"先逃出去再說！小丘郡沒了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"漢密爾頓上校","speakerId":"avg_npc_227_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒了？你*維多利亞粗口*給我閉嘴！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"漢密爾頓上校","speakerId":"avg_npc_227_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要有我在，這座城市就不會丟，永遠都是維多利亞的小丘郡！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"敵人不會放過您的，上校，他們不放過任何維多利亞士兵......您還是跟我們一塊撤吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"漢密爾頓上校","speakerId":"avg_npc_227_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"漢密爾頓上校","speakerId":"avg_npc_227_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你走吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"上校——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"漢密爾頓上校","speakerId":"avg_npc_227_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還站著幹什麼？逃吧，夾緊你的尾巴，從這裡低著頭逃出去！別再讓我看到你——除非你更想死在我手裡！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"......好，那我們走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"您......您保重！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"漢密爾頓上校","speakerId":"avg_npc_227_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"漢密爾頓上校","speakerId":"avg_npc_227_1","isRemote":false,"text":"保重？在戰場上？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"漢密爾頓上校","speakerId":"avg_npc_227_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這從來不是一名軍人該做的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"漢密爾頓上校","speakerId":"avg_npc_227_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——我的刀呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"漢密爾頓上校","speakerId":"avg_npc_227_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在這裡啊，老朋友......自從離開高速戰艦，你有多久沒聞到硝煙味了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"黑暗中，上校從自己的椅子上站起來，理了理制服的領口，走向那扇門。\n他挺直脊背，拔出制式軍刀，指向門外。\n火光湧了進來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"narration","text":"“我和我的騎兵刀，來自維多利亞！”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"21_G8_cammunibase"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雙簧管，我和大提琴已到通訊塔下！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們那邊怎麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雙簧管","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"隊長，一到七號平台的炸藥都已經埋好，就等著敵人過來！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，先從一號開始——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很好，敵人被引過去了！你們注意轉移！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大提琴，登塔！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雙簧管，二至三號爆破！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......雙簧管，我看到有更多術師在往通道那邊過去，你們要小心！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"注意這些術師的攻擊手段，我偵測到很強的能量在積聚——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"和敵人保持距離！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，立刻撤退！雙簧管，帶著你的人離開通道！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"敵人的源石技藝作用範圍太大，他們不準備找你們了，而是想用火球清掃全部平台！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雙簧管","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"知道了，隊長。那就看看誰更快了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雙簧管......！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大提琴，雙簧管為我們爭取到了一點時間，你繼續往上突進！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要找到控制台，就立刻把消息發出去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我會守在塔下，為你提供火力掩護。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"五分鐘。我保證，五分鐘之內，我不會讓一個敵人爬上通訊塔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"炮擊，準備——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......上面什麼情況，大提琴？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大提琴","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"還差十米......唔呃......！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"塔上還有敵人？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大提琴","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"有......弩手！在八點鐘方向！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......唔......敵人數量太多了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我過去，塔下就會失守......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"瞄準失敗......距離太遠，超出我的射程！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大提琴","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"管不了這麼多了......啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不行，再這樣下去，在碰到控制台之前，你就會失血而死！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"找掩體！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大提琴","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"拖著......也不行！隊長，你肯定也......受傷了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒問題......咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大提琴","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"別騙我了，隊長，現在第六分鐘過去了。你那裡有多少敵人？二十？三十？還是更多？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大提琴","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是不是都沒空說話了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大提琴","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"還有七米，我這就過去——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......怎麼樣了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大提琴","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊......哈！隊長，我沒事！有人幹掉了弩手！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？難道是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"隊長！！！我來了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......哈哈......這傢伙......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們再撐一會！就一會！我先弄倒這幾個噴火的敵人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大提琴，趁風笛吸引火力，快！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大提琴","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......隊長，我打開控制台了！就差一點......點......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大提琴","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呃......！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大提琴？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大提琴","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"石......石......隊長......小心......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼回事？！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——隊長！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"風笛撲向號角，兩人滾到了一邊。\n一根巨大的石柱迅速地從通訊塔上方落下，將號角原本所在的位置砸出一個深坑。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這好好的平台哪裡來的石柱......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......是鬼魂部隊的術師？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是你們的人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你殺了大提琴！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不喜歡別人不經允許就碰我的東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼叫你的東西？！明明是鬼魂部隊入侵了小丘郡！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵......哈！一聲招呼都不打就開炮？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是你們維多利亞軍隊的禮節嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你！你氣昏頭了嗎？！沒看到你的攻擊對我來說根本不起作用？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......碎石。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（所有角度都沒有弱點。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（在炮火近身之前，她就會調動周圍的石塊進行格擋。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（是她的源石技藝？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（......你看大提琴身上。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（這些傷口都是石錐造成的？而且兇器全部消失了......她既能操縱石塊來防禦，又能變出石頭來攻擊？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（那麻煩了。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（測試下她能做到什麼地步。一定會有破綻。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖，我現在懷疑你是想自殺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的戰士們早就把你的彈藥消耗得差不多了。再這麼轟下去，你很快就會失去進攻能力，只能空著手等死了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿赫茉妮那傢伙，在我來之前還反覆提醒，說你們有多麼多麼厲害。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，說什麼這才是維多利亞軍的真正樣貌......看看你們，手足無措，退無可退，這就是皇家近衛學校優等生的實力？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看和駐軍差不多嘛......不堪一擊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你很討厭維多利亞軍人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"猜錯了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不討厭任何士兵。無論聽誰的指揮，大家都是在戰場上搏命的可憐人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我討厭的是你們這樣的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過只是有個好出身，就以為自己有資格把我們踩在腳底下——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......能有什麼場景比看著你們反過來跪在我腳下更美妙呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去吧，穿刺——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有餘力擋下我的攻擊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"魯珀，你還挺能撐的嘛，比你那些一見我就嚇軟了腿的貴族同僚要出息不少！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還看不明白嗎？你們根本沒有機會！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"整個小丘郡都是我們的人，你們的人要嘛死了，要嘛一早向我們投降。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"順帶一提，你和你的小隊一進入小丘郡，就從來沒有離開過我們的視線。你的每一個舉動，我都看得清清楚楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......你們在駐軍裡安插了間諜？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你以為你的失敗是因為運氣不夠，或者自己不夠努力，判斷失誤，以至於錯失良機？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你錯了！命運從來沒有站在你們一邊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只因為——維多利亞已經拋棄了你們！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們比那些一無所知地在戰場上丟了性命的士兵還要可憐——你們甘願為了維多利亞浴血奮戰，卻成了國家的棄卒！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的意思是......不僅僅是一個間諜......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有很多軍隊裡的人......甚至高層......在支持你們？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那......你們的領袖......目標是什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是維多利亞......的冠冕？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"憑什......麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"住口！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就憑你——阿斯蘭的附庸，也配質疑領袖的高貴？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈......哈哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你笑什麼？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我笑你，自相矛盾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一邊對高高在上的貴族和富人咬牙切齒，一邊崇拜著你所謂的比任何人都高貴的“領袖”——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有比這更好笑的笑話嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你懂什麼！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"領袖......領袖的高貴可不僅僅是血統！她......她又有力量，又溫柔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，我明白了。你想拖延時間，從我嘴裡再套一點情報出來，對不對？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你以為你這些小伎倆能奏效？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪怕我跟你說了一些不該說的話，又有什麼關係呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們永遠都別想爬上這座通訊塔——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而聽到我這些話的人，不是死人，就是馬上要死的人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......那你還得再努力一些，小菲林。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是挺厲害的，你對武器的控制很精準。你一直在調整炮擊的方向，想試探我的源石技藝有沒有破綻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很遺憾——要是你沒有受這麼重的傷，彈藥也更充足，你搞不好真能傷到我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_233_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就這樣吧，閒談時間該結束了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就是現在！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"21_I9"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"什......麼？石柱突然倒了......砸到了我......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"瞎比劃了這麼久，我胳膊都酸了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那個瓦伊凡......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我還以為她是在胡亂攻擊，沒想到她的目標並不是我，始終都是塔下的石柱......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蔓德拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"該死......該死！你們怎麼會知道？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"隊長，她周圍的碎石沒了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"果然，我們的猜測是正確的，她的源石技藝雖然非常靈活，可在同一時間只能做一件事——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"無論是轉移碎石當護盾，還是釋放這些石刺，只要在施法的間隙期，她就會有破綻！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"趁現在石柱瞬間破壞了她的碎石盾——我們進攻！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
